[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677079086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99647#issuecomment-2677079086","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99647","id":2677079086,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fkPwu","user":{"login":"JosephHalter","id":116534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjUzNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter","html_url":"https://github.com/JosephHalter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephHalter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-23T19:43:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-23T19:43:27Z","body":"You should be receiving `InputEventPanGesture` and `InputEventMagnifyGesture` events instead, which you can handle in `_input`.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2677079086/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898217695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99647#issuecomment-2898217695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99647","id":2898217695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sv0rf","user":{"login":"DiplomaticRobot","id":40128966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTI4OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40128966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot","html_url":"https://github.com/DiplomaticRobot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T14:40:51Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T14:40:51Z","body":"I've encountered this same issue with Camera 2D, when i press with two fingers at the same time and then drag, i just get the InputEventScreenTouch for both fingers, but after that not a single InputEventScreenDrag is emited even if i keep dragging both fingers.\n\nI would expect an InputEventScreenDrag for both fingers with index=0 and index=1 at the same time.\n\nThis issue happens when trying to code the pinch gesture for zooming the camera.\n\nAdditionally InputEventMagnifyGesture seems to not be emited on iOS devices, but is emited on Android devices.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898217695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906693867","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99647#issuecomment-2906693867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99647","id":2906693867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tQKDr","user":{"login":"DiplomaticRobot","id":40128966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTI4OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40128966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot","html_url":"https://github.com/DiplomaticRobot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiplomaticRobot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-24T09:24:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-24T09:24:07Z","body":"Seems like this issue is resolved if input_devices/pointing/android/enable_pan_and_scale_gestures = false","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906693867/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3539833018","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99647#issuecomment-3539833018","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99647","id":3539833018,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S_ZC6","user":{"login":"MichaelGlenMontague","id":8346391,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDYzOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8346391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelGlenMontague","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelGlenMontague/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T03:43:45Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T03:43:45Z","body":"This is due to Godot triggering `InputEventGesture`s if you have them enabled, but I don't like that they block other touch events from even existing. For my project, I created a full two-finger translate/scale/rotate gesture, and so if `enable_pan_and_scale_gestures` is enabled, my custom gesture will be cancelled in favor of the built-in translate/scale version that doesn't include rotation.\n\nOf course, the solution in an exported project is to simply disable that option in the project settings. But that would not be ideal for an editor plugin because it either requires users to manually change that option in their editor settings, or the developer to implement some hack that automatically toggles that option for them.\n\nMy two cents is to just not block other events from existing when an `InputEventGesture` is happening, since it's easy to ignore the events that I don't want to use, but very difficult to use events that are not available.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3539833018/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]